  "paragraph": null,
  "text": "The AMF Q&A clarifies which activities fall within or outside the status of conseiller en investissements financiers (CIF) under articles L. 541-1 to L. 541-9-1 of the Code monétaire et financier and articles 325-1-A to 325-32 of the AMF General Regulation, and certain CIF obligations. A person who provides investment advice on a regular basis must hold the CIF status and be registered with ORIAS (summary of the cited page).",
